    "body": "Fix a potential use-after-free when storing or deleting instance attributes if a re-entrant ``__hash__`` mutates the instance ``__dict__`` during attribute handling.\r\n\r\nTemporarily INCREF the managed dict in the ``Py_GIL_DISABLED`` path to ensure it remains alive across the call to ``store_instance_attr_dict()``.\n\n<!-- gh-issue-number: gh-142731 -->\n* Issue: gh-142731\n<!-- /gh-issue-number -->\n",
